  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -ER verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *suspendido*",
    "*suspender un examen* = to fail an exam (*Suspendí matemáticas* — I failed maths)",
    "*suspender a alguien* = for a teacher to fail a student (*El profesor me suspendió* — The teacher failed me)",
    "*suspender un evento* = to call off/cancel an event (*Suspendieron el concierto por la lluvia* — They called off the concert due to rain)",
    "*suspender a alguien del trabajo* = to suspend someone from work",
    "Opposite: *aprobar* = to pass",
    "Related: *el suspenso* / *el suspenso* = fail grade; *la suspensión* = suspension, cancellation"
  ],
